msgctxt "80"
msgid "Oogh... Agh... I lost... Me, of all people..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Damn it all! I can't believe I lost to an amateur!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "You done mourning over your retirement?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I pretty much knew I had it coming... Besides, this\r\n"
"aching back of mine is permanently down for the count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Wrestling is a battle, of course, but it's also a show.\r\n"
"You gotta make it fun for the fans. That's the most\r\n"
"important thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"And it's not just about being strong, either. You gotta show\r\n"
"the kids something fresh... You gotta have flair! Sparkle!\r\n"
"Pizzazz! I dunno! You gotta have some styyyllle!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"With my back like this, I doubt I can have that kind of\r\n"
"performance ever again, so... Thanks for helping me make up\r\n"
"my mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "I'll take that offer of yours. I'll be your bouncer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Good, then let me set you up with this place. It's in a\r\n"
"building on Park Boulevard. You can head there whenever you're ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"It's a deal. And thanks, Kiryu-san. I guess I'll be seeing\r\n"
"you around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"There's nobody here... so we can duke it out all we want!\r\n"
"...Hey, you wanna know why they call me Violence Tobita?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Because I like to get violent... and rip the opponent to\r\n"
"bits! Get it? No? Fine, let's just do this!"
msgstr ""

